    "show_share": true,
    "description": "AASHA - Alliance Against Sexual Harassment at Workplace - presented an award to Aga Khan University in recognition of its conscious efforts to create a safe and enabling work environment for women, especially through its School of Nursing. The award was presented at AASHA's 10th Working Women's Assembly in Islamabad on December 22, 2010, with over 400 working women in attendance, all the way from Nagarparker to Peshawar.",
